// Photos for the Reference tab's mic cards, keyed by mic id.
//
// Entries for Wikimedia Commons images are GENERATED by
// scripts/fetch-mic-photos.mjs, which pulls author and licence straight from
// the Commons API so attribution can't be mistranscribed. Julian's own photos
// are added by hand in the same shape.
//
// A mic with no entry shows a placeholder and makes no request. Photos are
// listed here rather than probed for by filename precisely so that a
// photo-less mic costs nothing — with most of the pool unphotographed,
// probing would mean dozens of 404s on every render of the tab.
//
//   file        filename under /images/mics/
//   width,      pixel dimensions of that file, so the card reserves the right
//   height      space before the image loads
//   author      credited name, as the licence requires
//   authorUrl   optional link to the author's page
//   license     short name, e.g. "CC BY-SA 4.0"
//   licenseUrl  the licence deed
//   sourceUrl   where the original lives (the Commons file page)
//   modified    what was changed from the original, e.g. "resized" — CC
//               licences require changes to be indicated
//   origin      "commons" for entries the script owns and may rewrite. Leave
//               it off your own photos and the script will never touch them.
//   note        optional caveat about the identification, e.g. a near-
//               identical variant. Not shown on the card — it exists so a
//               caveat accepted once doesn't quietly harden into a fact.
